sm8750-dev
===========

Getting started
---------------

This repository contains local manifest overrides for the Android source tree. These manifests are cloned into `.repo/local_manifests` to extend or modify the default source manifest.

To initialize your local repository using these local manifests, use:
```
git clone https://github.com/sm8750-dev/manifest.git -b seventeen .repo/local_manifests
```
Then sync all repositories:
```
repo sync -c -j$(nproc --all) --force-sync --no-clone-bundle --no-tags --optimized-fetch
```
Optional cleanup:
```
repo prune
```
Please refer to the LineageOS Wiki (https://wiki.lineageos.org/) for general building instructions and tips.

Submitting patches
------------------
Patches are always welcome! If you make improvements to these local manifests or any related build scripts, please submit your patches via your preferred Git workflow.

Simply follow your usual Git workflow to submit pull requests or patches.

Builds
------
These local manifests are intended to be used in combination with the main source trees. Follow the standard build process for your device after syncing to produce builds.

Builds produced using these manifests can be managed and downloaded using your standard workflow or build server.

Resources
---------
- LineageOS Wiki: https://wiki.lineageos.org/ – General build instructions  
- Repo tool documentation: https://source.android.com/setup/develop/repo – More info on repo commands
